// Where each Pokémon can be found, keyed by national dex id, then by
// region id (matching REGIONS in data.js, e.g. "kanto"), then a list of
// areas. Sourced from encounters.csv across that region's own games; an
// empty list means no encounter row in any of them (evolution-only).
//
// Each area (0.2.7 shape) carries one line per encounter method:
//   { area: "Route 1", enc: [{ method: "Grass", min: 2, max: 7, rate: 70 }] }
// min/max = level range across every game and sub-area of that location;
// rate = the highest single-game, single-sub-area, single-condition slot
// total ("up to N%"), capped at 100 — games are never summed together.
// "Gift"/"Static"/"NPC Trade" methods are kept (they are what makes a
// starter's home town appear here). The Found In popup renders these; a
// bare string (pre-0.2.7 entry, populate_hisui_species.js) still renders
// as just the name.

